499
00:26:48.309 --> 00:26:50.344
Like he had
a big bunch of keys.

500
00:26:50.377 --> 00:26:53.280
Now, ballistics has their money
set on an XM21 sniper system.

501
00:26:53.314 --> 00:26:56.050
Used in Vietnam,
